<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - El Paso Energy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - El Paso Energy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of El Paso Energy Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- El Paso was off 7/8 to 55-1/4.</p>
</text>
